nt DoD/VA process allowing simultaneous military separation and VA disability rating.\n- **Warrior Transition Unit**: Provides structured support during recovery and transition.\n- **Purple Heart eligibility**: Awarded for combat-related injuries; entitles veteran to priority VA care.\n\n**Psychosocial Transition Support**:\n- Peer mentoring programs (Operation Comfort, Wounded Warrior Project)\n- Adaptive sports programs (VA Adaptive Sports, Paralympic military program)\n- Vet Center services for readjustment counseling\n- Suicide prevention coordinator engagement',
